changelog	Format: [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), versioning: [SemVer](https://semver.org/). The file format has its own version (`%KAPU 1.2`, see `SPEC-KAPU.md`); the tools below are versioned separately. Specification v1.2 and file format 1.2, from the two review records of 2026-10-26. KAPU is now aimed at two cases: a personal knowledge base and memory for coding agents on any platform, and knowledge for	kapu, file, kubernetes docs, tools, line, search, mdn, docs
changelog/unreleased		
changelog/0-2-0-2026-10-26	Specification v1.2 and file format 1.2, from the two review records of 2026-10-26. KAPU is now aimed at two cases: a personal knowledge base and memory for coding agents on any platform, and knowledge for local models with a small context.	
