overview	On a 207,000-token manual the model had never seen, Claude agents using KAPU answered **12 of 12** beginner questions while reading **4,104 tokens** per question: **half** of what the same agents read with grep over the Markdown file, and **2%** of pasting the whole manual into the context.	kapu, kapu file, file, agent, search, markdown, one, kapu file search
